    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n608" root="ارق" body-key="A">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرِقٌ</span></b>  <i>Sleepless</i> or <i>wakeful</i> (S, K) <i>by night</i> (K)
[<i>by reason of a malady,</i> or <i>a distracting accident</i>
or <i>event,</i> &amp;c. (see 1)]; as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آرِقٌ</span></b>  (IF, K) and
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرُقٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُرُقٌ</span></b> ; or the last signifies <i>habitually
so.</i> (TA.)

